ry 1 is 18. Write 8, carry 1..\n\nHundred millions place: 3 + 1 = 4, plus carry 1 is 5. Write 5..\n\nPutting all together: 5 (hundred millions), 8 (ten millions), 2 (millions), 8 (hundred thousands), 3 (ten thousands), 2 (thousands), 2 (hundreds), 7 (tens), 7 (ones)</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
