ition 4 (thousands):5 +4 =9 + carry 1 =10 → digit 0, carry 1.\nPosition 5 (ten thousands):7 +7 =14 + carry 1 =15 → digit 5, carry 1.\nPosition 6 (hundred thousands):8 +2 =10 + carry 1 =11 → digit 1, carry 1.\nPosition 7 (millions):4 +0 =4 + carry 1 =5 → digit 5, carry 0.\nPosition 8 (ten millions):7 +2 =9 → digit 9, carry 0.\nPosition 9 (hundred millions):3 +6 =9 → digit 9, carry 0.\n\nPutting it all together from the right: 3, 3, 0, 0, 5, 1, 5, 9, 9</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
