 +1=11 →1, carry1. Yes..\n\nThousands:4+7=11 +1=12 →2, carry1. Correct..\n\nTen-thousands:6+3=9 +1=10 →0, carry1. Wait, 6+3 is 9, plus carry 1 makes 10. So 0 here, carry1. Yes..\n\nHundred-thousands:9+5=14 +1=15 →5, carry1. Right..\n\nMillions place:8+7=15 +1=16 →6, carry1. Correct..\n\nTen-millions:8+3=11 +1=12 →2, carry1. Yes..\n\nHundred-millions:9+9=18 +1=19 →9, carry1. Then since there are no more digits, the carry1 becomes the next digit</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
