 0 + 5 = 5 + 1 (carry) = 6 → sum digit 6, carryover 0.\nPosition 4 (thousands): 3 + 2 = 5 → sum digit 5, carryover 0.\nPosition 5 (ten-thousands): 3 + 1 = 4 → sum digit 4, carryover 0.\nPosition 6 (hundred-thousands): 5 + 2 =7 → sum digit 7, carryover 0.\nPosition 7 (millions): 5 +1 =6 → sum digit 6, carryover 0.\nPosition 8 (ten-millions):6 +7=13 → sum digit 3, carryover 1.\nPosition 9 (hundred-millions):3 +3=6 +1 (carry)=7 → sum digit 7</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
