8 2 0 6 6 3 1 8.\n        -------------------.\n\nNow, starting from the right (ones):.\n\n1. Ones: 7 + 8 = 15 → 5, carry 1..\n2. Tens: 0 + 1 = 1 + 1 (carry) = 2. No carry..\n3. Hundreds: 3 + 3 = 6. No carry..\n4. Thousands: 9 + 6 = 15. So write 5, carry 1..\n5. Ten thousands: 3 + 6 = 9 + 1 (carry) = 10. Write 0, carry 1..\n6. Hundred thousands: 6 + 0 = 6 + 1 = 7. No carry..\n7. Millions: 0 + 2 = 2. No carry..\n8. Ten millions: 1 + 8 = 9. No carry..\n9. Hundred millions: 8 + 4 = 12. Since there are no higher places, write 12</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
