r 1. But since that's the highest place, we add the carryover as a new digit: 1..\n\nPutting all together: 1 (billions),8 (hundred millions),7 (ten millions),6 (millions),0 (hundred thousands),9 (ten thousands),9 (thousands),5 (hundreds),2 (tens),3 (ones)</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
