: The digits are 8 and 9. Adding them plus the carry-over: 8 + 9 + 1 = 18. So that's 8 in the hundred-millions place and we carry over 1 to the next higher place, which is the billions place..\n\nSince there are no more digits left, that carry-over 1 becomes the billions place</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
