 no more digits, the final carry-over of 1 goes to the billions place..\n\nPutting all those digits together: 1 (billions), 7 (hundred-millions), 1 (ten-millions), 2 (millions), 5 (hundred-thousands), 2 (ten-thousands), 4 (thousands), 9 (hundreds), 1 (tens), 0 (ones)</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
