y 1.\nPosition 6 (hundred thousands): 5 + 2 = 7 + 1 = 8 → 8, carry 0.\nPosition 7 (millions): 7 + 3 = 10 → 0, carry 1.\nPosition 8 (ten millions): 1 + 1 = 2 + 1 = 3 → 3, carry 0.\nPosition 9 (hundred millions): 4 + 1 = 5 → 5.\n\nPutting it all together from right to left: 3,9,9,0,4,8,0,3,5</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
