(hundred thousands).\n- 0 (ten thousands).\n- 9 (thousands).\n- 9 (hundreds).\n- 0 (tens).\n- 8 (ones).\n\n198,831,414:.\n- 1 (hundred millions).\n- 9 (ten millions).\n- 8 (millions).\n- 8 (hundred thousands).\n- 3 (ten thousands).\n- 1 (thousands).\n- 4 (hundreds).\n- 1 (tens).\n- 4 (ones).\n\nNow adding each column from right to left with carryover:.\n\nOnes: 8 +4 =12 → 2, carry 1..\n\nTens:0 +1 +1=2 → 2, no carry..\n\nHundreds:9 +4=13 →3, carry1..\n\nThousands:9 +1=10 →0, carry1..\n\nTen-thousands:0 +3 +1=4 →4, no carry..\n\nHundred-thousands:9 +8=17 →7, carry1..\n\nMillions:9 +8=17 →7, carry1..\n\nTen-millions:3 +9=12 →2, carry1..\n\nHundred-millions:7 +1 +1=9</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
